WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.427
Episode 6
Kouya

00:52.853 --> 00:55.686
I can't stand doing
such stupid things.

00:55.789 --> 00:57.017
It just makes me hungry.

00:58.893 --> 00:59.723
They look yummy...

01:06.834 --> 01:08.665
All right! I caught one!

01:12.773 --> 01:14.070
Hey! Sorata!

01:25.719 --> 01:27.016
Again?

01:31.258 --> 01:32.156
Oh, well.

01:35.796 --> 01:37.161
What, you were here?

01:38.399 --> 01:39.764
Then let's go.

01:46.640 --> 01:49.905
Hangin' out like this,
it's like a date or something.

01:50.010 --> 01:52.501
We're just together
because of work.

01:52.613 --> 01:55.548
I know that, but it
makes me all giddy.

01:55.649 --> 01:57.446
The weather's nice, too.

01:57.551 --> 01:59.781
A movie and a meal with you...

02:01.488 --> 02:03.820
That's like a dream story
for us, though...

02:05.025 --> 02:06.617
...it would be so nice.

02:17.137 --> 02:18.468
How about some tea?

02:20.074 --> 02:24.238
It's a very popular cake.
I waited in line for an hour to buy it.

02:24.345 --> 02:28.441
The Osaka boy that you said
you bumped into the other day, Yuto...

02:28.549 --> 02:31.177
Yes, did you find out
something about him?

02:31.285 --> 02:33.753
The name is Sorata Arisugawa.

02:33.854 --> 02:35.549
17 years old.

02:35.656 --> 02:38.557
He was a visitor
from Kouya Mountain.

02:41.028 --> 02:42.120
Oh?

02:42.229 --> 02:43.696
Kouya Mountain...

02:43.797 --> 02:46.459
The main headquarters
of the Shingon sect.

02:46.567 --> 02:49.968
One of the sanctuaries
still remaining in Japan.

02:50.070 --> 02:53.233
So Kouya had been hiding
one of the Seals, after all.

02:54.308 --> 02:57.175
But to think that boy
was a monk...

02:58.245 --> 03:01.237
Maybe I should say hello, too.

03:01.348 --> 03:02.645
Please do...

03:02.750 --> 03:05.776
He's an amusing lad
who won't bore you.

03:25.305 --> 03:26.567
How is he?

03:26.674 --> 03:30.110
He ate just a little bit
of the apples earlier, but...

03:30.210 --> 03:31.074
I see...

03:32.146 --> 03:34.512
I'll watch over him now,
so go home and sleep.

03:34.615 --> 03:35.809
It's all right.

03:35.916 --> 03:38.612
You have the district
finals tomorrow.

03:38.719 --> 03:40.084
I'll watch him tonight.

03:41.822 --> 03:44.017
It's all right.
I won't play.

03:44.124 --> 03:44.988
You can't!

03:45.092 --> 03:47.856
You've been practicing
so much for the game.

03:47.961 --> 03:51.988
First off, the whole team would
have a tough time if you bailed out!

03:52.099 --> 03:53.691
Are you fine with that?

03:56.770 --> 03:58.499
I can't help it.

03:58.605 --> 04:00.539
This isn't the time for all that.

04:01.608 --> 04:05.203
I'll watch over Father,
so it'll be all right.

04:06.413 --> 04:09.541
Father had been looking forward
to the finals, too.

04:14.488 --> 04:15.978
All right.

04:16.090 --> 04:16.988
I'll play.

04:18.292 --> 04:20.988
But I'll be at his side
for the night.

04:21.095 --> 04:24.360
I'll be fine without
sleep for one night.

04:24.465 --> 04:25.557
It's all right!

04:25.666 --> 04:26.655
No.

04:26.767 --> 04:28.894
Go home and get
a good night's rest.

04:29.002 --> 04:31.698
I'd be in trouble
if you collapsed, too.

04:33.807 --> 04:34.705
Right?

04:38.512 --> 04:40.377
All right, I understand.

04:40.481 --> 04:43.712
But you make sure you won't
lose tomorrow's match!

04:43.817 --> 04:46.012
Yeah, leave it to me.

04:46.120 --> 04:47.553
All right, do your best!

04:47.654 --> 04:48.552
Sure!

05:00.801 --> 05:02.962
Maybe I am tired, after all.

05:10.978 --> 05:13.003
OPERATING

05:14.081 --> 05:16.709
Your mother's illness
needs an operation.

05:17.785 --> 05:19.844
It's a very difficult operation.

05:19.953 --> 05:21.011
So pray with me.

05:21.121 --> 05:24.420
OPERATING

05:37.971 --> 05:38.869
Mother...

05:51.385 --> 05:52.477
Kamui...

05:54.721 --> 05:55.983
Are you all right?

06:17.377 --> 06:20.778
I'm sorry. You came out here
to visit my father.

06:21.882 --> 06:22.814
It's all right.

06:22.916 --> 06:24.315
Don't worry about it.

06:24.418 --> 06:26.283
Thank you so much... Really.

06:27.387 --> 06:28.979
Sure.

06:29.089 --> 06:29.987
Shirou?

06:31.859 --> 06:32.723
Um...

06:32.826 --> 06:36.728
My big brother's playing
in the district finals tomorrow.

06:36.830 --> 06:39.230
I can't go because
I'll be with Father,

06:39.333 --> 06:41.358
but if you could,
I'd like you to.

06:42.436 --> 06:45.234
He's going through
a tough time right now,

06:45.339 --> 06:48.274
but I'm sure he'd do his best
if you went there.

06:50.077 --> 06:51.476
It's not my business.

06:54.281 --> 06:56.681
I'm sorry for
sounding so selfish...

07:07.561 --> 07:09.028
She really is a good girl.

07:10.097 --> 07:12.998
Kamui should be just
a little bit kinder to her.

07:14.067 --> 07:17.161
There aren't that many
good girls like her around...

07:17.271 --> 07:19.296
Of course, you're up
there as well, missie.

07:19.406 --> 07:21.237
I decided on you.

07:22.843 --> 07:25.778
Well, you are really beautiful!

07:25.879 --> 07:28.871
You're a priestess
from Ise Shrine, right?

07:28.982 --> 07:33.612
I'm sure you look great
when you wear the priestess' outfit!

07:33.720 --> 07:36.450
Could you wear the traditional
garb for me once?

07:36.556 --> 07:40.515
Though you wear that outfit
only in emergency situations.

07:41.895 --> 07:44.887
The hidden priestess
is the protector of Ise Shrine.

07:44.998 --> 07:49.492
She hides all the spiritual powers
of the Ise gods in her, apparently.

07:49.603 --> 07:52.231
Rumors of Ise Shrine's
true spiritual offering...

07:52.339 --> 07:56.366
...being hidden inside the hidden
priestess' body were true, I guess.

07:59.713 --> 08:02.113
That rough look
on your face is so great!

08:13.293 --> 08:14.658
SEINAN JOTOKU

08:14.761 --> 08:16.752
What's wrong, Monou?

08:16.863 --> 08:18.694
You're not yourself today.

08:18.799 --> 08:20.664
We're in serious trouble.

08:20.767 --> 08:23.133
Jotoku's setting the pace.

08:23.236 --> 08:24.760
Don't sound so wimpy!

08:24.871 --> 08:28.466
They may have height,
but we still have more speed!

08:28.575 --> 08:32.511
If we can perform like we usually do,
I'm sure we can win!

08:32.612 --> 08:34.136
Right, Monou?

08:34.247 --> 08:35.145
Yeah...

08:43.090 --> 08:43.954
Kamui...

08:49.396 --> 08:51.728
Kamui has a good side,
surprisingly.

08:52.833 --> 08:56.200
But he's still far from amiable.

08:57.437 --> 09:00.600
I'd like to see him smile once.

09:00.707 --> 09:04.336
Well, I guess
nobody'd be able to...

09:04.444 --> 09:06.503
...with such a burden of destiny.

09:08.048 --> 09:10.915
I'm much more
sanguine compared to him.

09:12.285 --> 09:13.183
Is that so?

09:14.788 --> 09:16.221
I heard...

09:16.323 --> 09:20.384
...of the star that the famous
Kouya Stargazer carefully raised.

09:20.494 --> 09:24.260
His powers are close to
that of Kouya Mountain's founder.

09:25.766 --> 09:29.361
Man, you'll make me blush
with so much praise!

09:33.206 --> 09:34.400
But I really...

09:35.942 --> 09:37.000
...am sanguine.

09:38.111 --> 09:42.445
I haven't suffered like Kamui
with the death of his mom or anything.

09:42.549 --> 09:46.815
I'd been brought to Kouya
before I could remember anything.

09:49.589 --> 09:52.820
Well, tough memories
of the past...

09:56.463 --> 09:59.296
No, I don't even remember
those too much.

09:59.399 --> 10:00.957
I'm all right.

10:01.068 --> 10:03.036
I've decided on you already.

10:03.136 --> 10:04.569
- Um...
- Well...

10:04.671 --> 10:06.161
The second half's beginnin'.

10:06.273 --> 10:08.241
Since we came all the way
to cheer 'em on...

10:08.341 --> 10:09.968
...I hope they do their best.

10:37.737 --> 10:37.759
SEINAN JOTOKU

10:49.683 --> 10:52.811
Looks like that guy's
finally gettin' up to speed.

10:55.255 --> 10:56.153
Um...

10:57.991 --> 10:59.856
I've been meaning to ask you...

11:06.133 --> 11:10.627
If you're askin' where to get good
okonomiyaki, I know a great place!

11:10.737 --> 11:13.171
I'm not talking about that.

11:13.273 --> 11:15.537
Then a place for takoyaki?

11:15.642 --> 11:20.511
When I first met you, you said
that you "decided" on me.

11:20.614 --> 11:21.842
Yeah, I said that.

11:22.949 --> 11:25.349
I've decided on you, missie.

11:25.452 --> 11:27.920
About that...
what did you decide?

11:29.422 --> 11:31.947
The one who I will
sacrifice my life for.

11:37.597 --> 11:39.565
The old stargazer told me.

11:49.042 --> 11:54.207
You will become one of
the "seven stars of the sky."

11:57.851 --> 12:00.376
You will use that power...

12:00.487 --> 12:04.548
...to become one of those
who will determine Earth's fate.

12:06.493 --> 12:11.362
Sorata, meet Kamui
and be of his aid.

12:11.464 --> 12:14.331
And protect Kamui with your life.

12:18.805 --> 12:23.674
But you will die
for the sake of a woman.

12:24.978 --> 12:26.673
For a woman?

12:26.780 --> 12:28.304
That's right.

12:28.415 --> 12:33.819
You will lose your life for the sake
of the woman that you love.

12:39.926 --> 12:43.089
Nothing the old
stargazer's said...

12:43.196 --> 12:45.221
...has ever not come true.

12:47.167 --> 12:50.933
So that means I'm gonna die
for the sake of a woman.

12:52.739 --> 12:55.708
I don't know why I'm gonna
die for a woman,

12:55.809 --> 12:59.040
despite doing everything
possible to protect Kamui.

13:00.814 --> 13:03.612
But ever since I heard that,
I decided...

13:04.918 --> 13:07.648
that if I were to die
for a woman...

13:07.754 --> 13:10.188
...I'd rather have her
be a beautiful woman.

13:10.290 --> 13:12.884
You're really beautiful, missie.

13:12.993 --> 13:14.585
That's why I decided on you.

13:14.694 --> 13:17.959
We just met,
and we've hardly talked.

13:18.064 --> 13:20.931
- What basis...
- One look is enough.

13:21.034 --> 13:24.094
Time doesn't matter
when falling in love with a girl.

13:30.410 --> 13:35.109
I know that Kouya's astrology
has never been proven false.

13:35.215 --> 13:37.376
But this and that are...

13:37.484 --> 13:40.419
It's nothing for you
to worry about, missie.

13:40.520 --> 13:42.579
I'm just gonna die on my own...

13:42.689 --> 13:43.678
You're so...

13:47.394 --> 13:51.387
Perhaps our destinies
are really all foreordained.

13:51.498 --> 13:53.159
All we can do...

13:53.266 --> 13:57.202
...is live and die as the Seven Seals,
as Dragons of Heaven.

13:59.039 --> 14:03.066
In that case, it's all the more reason
to live life to the fullest.

14:05.378 --> 14:07.938
That's how I've
felt since that time.

14:47.887 --> 14:49.377
Hey! Sorata!

14:49.489 --> 14:51.081
Wait!

14:51.191 --> 14:52.522
Wait, Sorata!

14:52.625 --> 14:54.354
Thanks for the food!

14:54.461 --> 14:56.258
Hey! Sorata!

14:56.363 --> 14:58.558
Leave the pastries behind!

14:58.665 --> 15:00.895
Wait, Sorata!

15:01.000 --> 15:02.524
What a boy...

15:04.070 --> 15:08.803
He still hasn't had enough even
after eating so much for dinner.

15:11.644 --> 15:14.807
Sorata's powers are
increasing even more lately.

15:15.882 --> 15:20.046
There isn't anyone here in Kouya
that can win against him now.

15:20.153 --> 15:24.021
The seven stars of the sky,
the Dragons of Heaven...

15:24.124 --> 15:26.991
In following the stargazing,
I tore...

15:27.093 --> 15:30.859
...a 3-year-old Sorata away
from his parents and brought him here.

15:30.964 --> 15:34.957
He doesn't even remember
his parents' faces.

15:37.137 --> 15:39.662
Even though it was
to protect this world...

15:40.774 --> 15:44.733
...I might have done
something rather harsh.

15:46.646 --> 15:48.671
You're thinking
too hard, Gramps.

15:56.122 --> 15:57.419
I like it here.

15:58.525 --> 16:01.358
You're really scary
when you're mad...

16:01.461 --> 16:04.021
...but when you're kind,
you're really nice.

16:04.130 --> 16:06.291
And I'm really grateful.

16:06.399 --> 16:07.991
Grateful?

16:08.101 --> 16:10.661
Remember what you said
the other day, Gramps?

16:10.770 --> 16:13.898
That I'd die for the sake
of the woman I love.

16:14.007 --> 16:18.842
I can't remember
what my mom's face looked like...

16:18.945 --> 16:20.572
...except she was crying.

16:20.680 --> 16:23.205
So much that I don't
want to think about it.

16:24.417 --> 16:26.351
It kinda looked lonely...

16:26.453 --> 16:28.512
And seeing it made me lonely.

16:29.656 --> 16:32.784
I don't like it when
women are crying.

16:32.892 --> 16:36.328
That's why I don't ever want
to make the woman I love cry.

16:38.731 --> 16:41.825
Gramps, you taught me
how to use my powers.

16:42.936 --> 16:47.202
So that I can die protecting
the woman I'll fall in love with.

16:47.307 --> 16:50.174
That's why I'm so grateful
to you, Gramps.

16:52.245 --> 16:53.337
Sorata...

16:56.316 --> 16:57.214
So...

16:59.219 --> 17:00.811
Gramps, pray with me...

17:00.920 --> 17:03.912
...that the girl I fall for is
gonna be one beautiful lady.

17:06.993 --> 17:08.790
I'm still in my growth spurt.

17:08.895 --> 17:11.193
- I can't help it.
- Oh, it's Sorata!

17:11.297 --> 17:12.992
Hey, Sorata!

17:13.099 --> 17:14.225
Leave the pastries behind!

17:17.570 --> 17:18.764
Sorata!

17:22.275 --> 17:25.711
Gramps... looks like
your prayers went through...

17:35.288 --> 17:37.153
Well, I guess it's almost time.

17:39.292 --> 17:40.384
Yes.

17:40.493 --> 17:41.983
Then let's go.

18:25.939 --> 18:27.839
BEAST

18:41.554 --> 18:42.452
Rebound!

18:46.526 --> 18:47.891
Go, Monou!

18:53.266 --> 18:54.893
SEINAN JOTOKU

18:58.805 --> 19:01.433
- All right!
- We won!

19:15.755 --> 19:16.653
Kamui!

19:21.294 --> 19:22.818
I was surprised you came.

19:22.929 --> 19:24.590
Thank you.

19:24.697 --> 19:26.221
You should thank Kotori.

19:39.912 --> 19:41.777
That really was so like him.

19:43.049 --> 19:44.846
You got hurt because of me.

19:46.119 --> 19:47.916
This is nothing.

19:48.021 --> 19:50.854
I mean, I did
decide on you, missie.

20:17.150 --> 20:20.176
That's what I love so
much about you, missie.

20:22.789 --> 20:24.984
Gramps, look at her!

20:25.091 --> 20:27.082
She's the woman I decided on!

20:27.193 --> 20:28.023
Well?

20:28.127 --> 20:30.322
Isn't she the most
beautiful on Earth?

20:35.334 --> 20:36.995
I'm gonna do it, Gramps.

20:37.103 --> 20:38.900
I'll protect her and Kamui...

20:39.005 --> 20:41.667
...with everything I have,
as long as I'm alive.

20:41.774 --> 20:45.403
You listenin', Dragons of Earth?
I'll take you with just my right arm!

20:45.511 --> 20:48.878
I'll crumple you into a little ball
and throw you in the trash!

20:48.981 --> 20:52.712
As long as I'm around, the future
of Earth is safe and sound!
